{"identity_key": "bilibili:1266420931043000325", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1266420931043000325", "content": "变幻自如⁉\n纯夏的头发（呆毛）似乎会随着她的喜怒哀乐改变形状。\n这既是她的魅力所在，也是能让武直观感受到纯夏情绪的便利之处。\n当她生气时，呆毛会变得如闪电般锐利。", "publisher": "Muv-Luv官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1266420931043000325", "published_at": "2026-11-03T10:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/84b05c7f1dea9547790ae903b8df770d3546900143802616.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546900143802616", "uid": "3546900143802616", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "变幻自如⁉", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 59, "retweets": 3, "replies": 3}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
